---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const title = 'Contact | dogbitesettlementcalc.com';
const description = 'Contact the dogbitesettlementcalc.com editorial team with corrections, feedback, or questions about dog bite injury law content.';
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <h1>Contact dogbitesettlementcalc.com</h1>
  <p>The best way to reach us is by email at <a href="mailto:hey@theclicklab.agency">hey@theclicklab.agency</a>. We read every message and respond to substantive corrections and editorial feedback within five business days.</p>

  <h2>What We Can Help With</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Factual corrections:</strong> If you have identified an incorrect state liability classification, a statute that has been amended, or a damages figure inconsistent with published verdict data, please share the specific claim, the page URL, and your source. We review and correct promptly.</li>
    <li><strong>Methodology questions:</strong> If you have questions about the severity multipliers, liability adjustments, or provocation reductions the calculator uses, see the <a href="/methodology/">methodology page</a> first — the full documentation is there. For follow-up questions, email us.</li>
    <li><strong>Missing topics:</strong> If a liability theory, state-specific rule, or practical step is missing from our guides or FAQ, we welcome suggestions for content improvements.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>What We Cannot Help With</h2>
  <p>We cannot provide legal advice or case-specific analysis. We do not respond to questions such as "Do I have a dog bite claim?", "How much is my bite worth?", or "What should I do about my specific situation?" For case-specific guidance, consult a personal injury attorney in your state. Most dog bite attorneys offer free initial consultations and work on contingency.</p>

  <h2>Advertising</h2>
  <p>dogbitesettlementcalc.com is monetized exclusively through Google AdSense display advertising. We do not accept sponsored content, paid placements, or advertising arrangements outside the AdSense platform. Advertising-related inquiries will not receive a response.</p>

  <p>Return to the <a href="/">calculator</a> or see the <a href="/faq/">FAQ</a>.</p>
</BaseLayout>
